<#odin-highest>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "Which god is the highest and oldest of the Æsir, called Allfather?"@en ,
                     "Vilken gud är den högste och äldste av asarna och kallas Allfader?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Odin"@en ,
                    "Oden"@sv .

<#thor-domain>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "What is Thor the god of?"@en ,
                     "Vad är Tor gud för?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "thunder"@en ,
                    "åskan"@sv ;
    solid-memo:backNote "The Prose Edda calls him the strongest of all gods and men."@en ,
                        "Snorres Edda kallar honom den starkaste av alla gudar och människor."@sv .

<#baldr-fairest>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "Which god is so fair and bright that light shines from him, the best of the Æsir?"@en ,
                     "Vilken gud är så fager och strålande att det lyser om honom, den bäste av asarna?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Baldr"@en ,
                    "Balder"@sv .

<#njord-domain>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "What does Njord rule over, according to the Prose Edda?"@en ,
                     "Vad råder Njord över enligt Snorres Edda?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "the wind and the sea"@en ,
                    "vinden och havet"@sv ;
    solid-memo:backNote "Seafarers and fishermen call on him. The Prose Edda adds that he checks the fury of fire."@en ,
                        "Sjöfarare och fiskare åkallar honom. Snorres Edda tillägger att han dämpar eldens raseri."@sv .

<#freyr-domain>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "What does Freyr rule over, according to the Prose Edda?"@en ,
                     "Vad råder Frej över enligt Snorres Edda?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "rain, sunshine and the fruits of the earth"@en ,
                    "regn, solsken och jordens gröda"@sv ;
    solid-memo:backNote "It is good to call on him for harvests and peace."@en ,
                        "Honom åkallar man för god skörd och fred."@sv .

<#freyja-domain>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "In what matters is it good to call on Freyja, according to the Prose Edda?"@en ,
                     "I vilka angelägenheter är det enligt Snorres Edda gott att åkalla Freja?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "love"@en ,
                    "kärlek"@sv ;
    solid-memo:backNote "When she rides to battle, half of the slain are hers and half are Odin's."@en ,
                        "När hon rider till strid tillfaller hälften av de stupade henne och hälften Oden."@sv .

<#tyr-domain>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "What is Tyr the god of?"@en ,
                     "Vad är Tyr gud för?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "war"@en ,
                    "kriget"@sv ;
    solid-memo:backNote "He decides victory in war, so warriors call on him."@en ,
                        "Han avgör segern i krig, och därför åkallar krigare honom."@sv .

<#bragi-domain>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "What is Bragi the god of?"@en ,
                     "Vad är Brage gud för?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "poetry"@en ,
                    "skaldekonsten"@sv ;
    solid-memo:backNote "The Prose Edda calls him a master skald, famed for his eloquence."@en ,
                        "Snorres Edda kallar honom en mästerskald, berömd för sin vältalighet."@sv .

<#heimdall-watchman>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "What is Heimdall's task among the gods?"@en ,
                     "Vad är Heimdalls uppgift bland gudarna?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "watchman of the gods"@en ,
                    "gudarnas väktare"@sv ;
    solid-memo:backNote "He sits at the end of heaven and guards the bridge against the giants."@en ,
                        "Han sitter vid himlens ände och vaktar bron mot jättarna."@sv .

<#idun-apples>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "What does the goddess Idun keep?"@en ,
                     "Vad förvarar gudinnan Idun?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "the apples that make the gods young again"@en ,
                    "äpplena som gör gudarna unga igen"@sv ;
    solid-memo:backNote "She is Bragi's wife."@en ,
                        "Hon är Brages hustru."@sv .

<#loki-deceit>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "Which god does the Prose Edda call the originator of deceit and the disgrace of gods and men?"@en ,
                     "Vilken gud kallar Snorres Edda svekets upphovsman och gudars och människors skam?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Loki"@en ,
                    "Loke"@sv .

<#thor-mother>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "Who is Thor's mother?"@en ,
                     "Vem är Tors mor?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Jord"@en ,
                    "Jord"@sv ;
    solid-memo:backNote "Her name means “earth”; she is also called Fjorgyn and Hlodyn. Thor's father is Odin."@en ,
                        "Namnet betyder ”jord”; hon kallas även Fjorgyn och Lodyn. Tors far är Oden."@sv .

<#baldr-parents>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "Who are Baldr's parents?"@en ,
                     "Vilka är Balders föräldrar?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Odin and Frigg"@en ,
                    "Oden och Frigg"@sv .

<#njord-children>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "Which god is the father of Freyr and Freyja?"@en ,
                     "Vilken gud är far till Frej och Freja?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Njord"@en ,
                    "Njord"@sv .

<#angrboda>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "Which giantess had three children with Loki?"@en ,
                     "Vilken jättekvinna fick tre barn med Loke?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Angrboda"@en ,
                    "Angerboda"@sv ;
    solid-memo:backNote "The wolf Fenrir, the serpent Jörmungandr and Hel."@en ,
                        "Fenrisulven, Midgårdsormen och Hel."@sv .

<#fenrir>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "What is the giant wolf that is Loki's son called?"@en ,
                     "Vad heter den väldiga ulv som är Lokes son?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Fenrir"@en ,
                    "Fenrisulven"@sv .

<#jormungandr>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "Which of Loki's children is the serpent that lies in the ocean around the whole earth?"@en ,
                     "Vilket av Lokes barn är ormen som ligger i havet runt hela jorden?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Jörmungandr"@en ,
                    "Midgårdsormen"@sv ;
    solid-memo:backNote "Also called the Midgard Serpent."@en ,
                        "Kallas även Jörmungand."@sv .

<#hel>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "Which of Loki's children did Odin cast into Niflheim to rule over the dead?"@en ,
                     "Vilket av Lokes barn kastade Oden ned i Nifelhem för att råda över de döda?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Hel"@en ,
                    "Hel"@sv ;
    solid-memo:backNote "Those who die of sickness or old age come to her."@en ,
                        "Till henne kommer de som dör av sjukdom eller ålderdom."@sv .

<#sleipnir-mother>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "Which god gave birth to Odin's eight-legged horse?"@en ,
                     "Vilken gud födde Odens åttabenta häst?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Loki"@en ,
                    "Loke"@sv ;
    solid-memo:backNote "In the shape of a mare, Loki had lured away Svadilfari, the stallion of the giant who built the gods' stronghold."@en ,
                        "I skepnad av ett sto hade Loke lockat bort Svadilfare, hingsten som tillhörde jätten som byggde gudarnas borg."@sv .

<#mjolnir>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "What is Thor's hammer called?"@en ,
                     "Vad heter Tors hammare?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Mjölnir"@en ,
                    "Mjölner"@sv .

<#sleipnir>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "What is Odin's eight-legged horse called?"@en ,
                     "Vad heter Odens åttabenta häst?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Sleipnir"@en ,
                    "Sleipner"@sv .

<#huginn-muninn>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "What are Odin's two ravens called?"@en ,
                     "Vad heter Odens två korpar?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Huginn and Muninn"@en ,
                    "Hugin och Munin"@sv ;
    solid-memo:backNote "Their names mean “thought” and “memory”; every day they fly over the world and bring Odin news."@en ,
                        "Namnen betyder ”tanken” och ”minnet”; varje dag flyger de över världen och bär nyheter till Oden."@sv .

<#gungnir>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "What is Odin's spear called?"@en ,
                     "Vad heter Odens spjut?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Gungnir"@en ,
                    "Gungner"@sv ;
    solid-memo:backNote "Dwarfs, the sons of Ivaldi, made it."@en ,
                        "Det smiddes av dvärgar, Ivaldes söner."@sv .

<#gleipnir>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "What is the fetter that holds the wolf Fenrir called?"@en ,
                     "Vad heter bojan som håller Fenrisulven bunden?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Gleipnir"@en ,
                    "Gleipner"@sv ;
    solid-memo:backNote "Dwarfs made it of six things, among them the footfall of cats and the roots of the mountains."@en ,
                        "Dvärgar gjorde den av sex ting, bland dem kattens steg och bergens rötter."@sv .

<#valkyries>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "What are the women called whom Odin sends to every battle to choose who will be slain?"@en ,
                     "Vad kallas de kvinnor som Oden sänder till varje strid för att välja vilka som ska falla?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "valkyries"@en ,
                    "valkyrior"@sv .

<#ymir>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "From which giant's body did Odin and his brothers make the world?"@en ,
                     "Av vilken jättes kropp skapade Oden och hans bröder världen?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Ymir"@en ,
                    "Ymer"@sv ;
    solid-memo:backNote "From his flesh came the earth, from his blood the sea and from his skull the sky."@en ,
                        "Av hans kött blev jorden, av hans blod havet och av hans huvudskål himlen."@sv .

<#surtr>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "Which giant with a flaming sword will burn up the whole world with fire at its end?"@en ,
                     "Vilken jätte med ett flammande svärd ska bränna upp hela världen med eld vid dess slut?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Surtr"@en ,
                    "Surt"@sv ;
    solid-memo:backNote "At Ragnarök he kills Freyr."@en ,
                        "Vid Ragnarök dräper han Frej."@sv .

<#yggdrasil>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "What is the ash called whose branches spread over the whole world and reach above heaven?"@en ,
                     "Vad heter asken vars grenar breder ut sig över hela världen och når upp över himlen?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Yggdrasil"@en ,
                    "Yggdrasil"@sv ;
    solid-memo:backNote "The gods meet in council by it every day."@en ,
                        "Vid den håller gudarna ting varje dag."@sv .

<#bifrost>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "What is the bridge from earth to heaven called, which men see as the rainbow?"@en ,
                     "Vad heter bron från jorden till himlen, som människorna ser som regnbågen?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Bifröst"@en ,
                    "Bifrost"@sv .

<#valhalla>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "What is Odin's hall for those who fall in battle called?"@en ,
                     "Vad heter Odens hall för dem som stupar i strid?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Valhalla"@en ,
                    "Valhall"@sv .

<#asgard>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "What is the home of the Æsir called?"@en ,
                     "Vad heter asarnas hemvist?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Asgard"@en ,
                    "Asgård"@sv .

<#midgard>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "What is the world of humans called?"@en ,
                     "Vad heter människornas värld?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Midgard"@en ,
                    "Midgård"@sv ;
    solid-memo:backNote "The gods made its wall from Ymir's eyebrows."@en ,
                        "Gudarna gjorde dess mur av Ymers ögonbryn."@sv .

<#jotunheim>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "What is the land of the giants called?"@en ,
                     "Vad heter jättarnas land?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Jotunheim"@en ,
                    "Jotunheim"@sv .

<#muspelheim>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "Which world in the south is so hot and bright that no stranger can endure it?"@en ,
                     "Vilken värld i söder är så het och ljus att ingen främling står ut där?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Muspelheim"@en ,
                    "Muspelhem"@sv .

<#niflheim>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "Which cold and grim world existed many ages before the earth was made?"@en ,
                     "Vilken kall och dyster värld fanns långt innan jorden skapades?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Niflheim"@en ,
                    "Nifelhem"@sv .

<#ragnarok>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "What is the name for the gods' last battle and the destruction of the world?"@en ,
                     "Vad kallas gudarnas sista strid och världens undergång?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Ragnarök"@en ,
                    "Ragnarök"@sv .

<#odin-eye>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "What did Odin leave as a pledge to drink from Mimir's well?"@en ,
                     "Vad lämnade Oden som pant för att få dricka ur Mimers brunn?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "one of his eyes"@en ,
                    "ett av sina ögon"@sv .

<#tyr-hand>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "Which god lost his hand to the wolf Fenrir?"@en ,
                     "Vilken gud miste sin hand till Fenrisulven?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Tyr"@en ,
                    "Tyr"@sv ;
    solid-memo:backNote "He laid it in the wolf's mouth as a pledge while the gods bound the wolf."@en ,
                        "Han lade den i ulvens mun som pant medan gudarna band ulven."@sv .

<#baldr-killer>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "Which god, guided by Loki, killed Baldr?"@en ,
                     "Vilken gud dödade Balder på Lokes anstiftan?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Hodr"@en ,
                    "Höder"@sv ;
    solid-memo:backNote "Hodr was blind; he threw the mistletoe that Loki gave him."@en ,
                        "Höder var blind; han kastade misteln som Loke gav honom."@sv .

<#baldr-mistletoe>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "What was the one thing that had not sworn to spare Baldr?"@en ,
                     "Vad var det enda som inte hade svurit att skona Balder?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "the mistletoe"@en ,
                    "misteln"@sv ;
    solid-memo:backNote "Frigg thought it too young to ask for an oath."@en ,
                        "Frigg tyckte att den var för ung för att avkrävas en ed."@sv .

<#ragnarok-odin>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "Who kills Odin at Ragnarök?"@en ,
                     "Vem dödar Oden vid Ragnarök?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Fenrir"@en ,
                    "Fenrisulven"@sv ;
    solid-memo:backNote "The wolf swallows him."@en ,
                        "Ulven slukar honom."@sv .

<#ragnarok-vidar>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "Which son of Odin kills the wolf Fenrir at Ragnarök?"@en ,
                     "Vilken av Odens söner dödar Fenrisulven vid Ragnarök?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Vidar"@en ,
                    "Vidar"@sv ;
    solid-memo:backNote "He tears the wolf's jaws apart, avenging his father."@en ,
                        "Han river isär ulvens käftar och hämnas sin far."@sv .

<#ragnarok-thor>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "Which monster does Thor kill at Ragnarök before dying of its venom himself?"@en ,
                     "Vilket odjur dödar Tor vid Ragnarök, innan han själv dör av dess gift?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Jörmungandr"@en ,
                    "Midgårdsormen"@sv ;
    solid-memo:backNote "Thor walks nine paces before he falls dead. The serpent is also called the Midgard Serpent."@en ,
                        "Tor går nio steg innan han faller död. Ormen kallas även Jörmungand."@sv .

<#ragnarok-heimdall>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "Which god does Heimdall fight at Ragnarök, so that they kill each other?"@en ,
                     "Vilken gud strider Heimdall mot vid Ragnarök, så att de dödar varandra?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Loki"@en ,
                    "Loke"@sv .

<#turtle>
    a dcat:Distribution ;
    dcat:accessURL <> ;
    dcat:downloadURL <> ;
    dcat:mediaType <https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/text/turtle> ;
    dcterms:format <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/RDF_TURTLE> .
